A retail organisation has transactional data across customers, products, orders, shipments, and returns, but the data is scattered across raw source files, making it difficult to maintain a unified and trustworthy view of business performance. The objective is to build a governed, layered data warehouse in Snowflake that ingests, cleans, and models the raw retail data into a structured dimensional model and provides ready-to-use KPIs and analytical views for a self-service Streamlit dashboard covering sales, profitability, delivery performance, and return patterns.
